00:38:24.530 --> 00:38:53.780
I'm a hero.

00:38:53.780 --> 00:39:10.980
Clark?

00:39:10.980 --> 00:39:20.809
Not that I'm an interior designer, but one of these things doesn't exactly go with the other.

00:39:20.809 --> 00:39:25.269
I'm sorry we missed our dance.

00:39:25.269 --> 00:39:28.269
You don't need to worry about me, Clark.

00:39:28.269 --> 00:39:33.269
If anybody understands deadlines and urgent things, it's me.

00:39:33.269 --> 00:39:38.949
I'm not worried about you.

00:39:38.949 --> 00:39:46.900
I missed you.

00:39:46.900 --> 00:39:50.900
Neither of us are primed for dancing with the stars and speaking strictly as friends.

00:39:50.900 --> 00:39:52.900
I don't know if this is such a good idea.

00:39:52.900 --> 00:39:59.449
Lois, get over here.

00:39:59.449 --> 00:40:00.449
Not sure how we're going to make this.

00:40:00.449 --> 00:40:04.449
work without the jukebox nostalgia and the balloons and...

00:40:04.449 --> 00:40:05.449
Lois?

00:40:05.449 --> 00:40:09.340
Shut up.

00:40:09.340 --> 00:40:17.179
Right.

00:40:17.179 --> 00:40:18.179
Sorry?

00:40:18.179 --> 00:40:20.179
Hey, I'm the one to put my feet under yours.

00:40:20.179 --> 00:40:21.179
No, I...

00:40:21.179 --> 00:40:25.550
Just try this.

00:40:25.550 --> 00:40:45.849
I love you.

00:40:45.849 --> 00:40:50.050
Love you too.

00:40:50.050 --> 00:41:02.860
Clark, there's something that we need to talk about.

00:41:02.860 --> 00:41:04.860
Just for now.

00:41:04.860 --> 00:41:06.860
Can we leave tomorrow?

00:41:06.860 --> 00:41:08.860
Until tomorrow we just have this.

00:41:08.860 --> 00:41:10.860
Hmm.

